      "hosted_runtime_acceptance_claimed": false,
      "summary": "Verified immutable design 43473d1512dbb094074ec575ac1128be9b02e634 section 4 and original T3 acceptance: E_close must restore active_count to the pre-C baseline and leave zero active chain bindings while never touching unrelated non-chain records. Reproduced the Oct 24 baseline snapshot (active_count=1, rb-3a7f9d9682ff4e359d9b8a8d352a9831) retired at 2026-10-25T03:32:15Z and replaced by accepted release rb-b74c4828c4454ffcbca07b82d31f4ee7 (dev-paper-release-40226368878-1)."
    },
    "criterion_2_e_close_baseline_comparison_and_immutable_history": {
      "source_contract_verified": true,
      "hosted_runtime_acceptance_claimed": false,
      "summary": "HostedChainRunner._close captures active non-chain binding IDs, necessary Runtime owner identity/tenant/stable state, and genuinely exposed versions (Runtime artifact_version and Registry strategy-artifact version) at E_close start and compares them at E_close end. Only records belonging to THIS chain are excluded/retired; other chains are preserved as non-chain records. Normal create-before-retire replacements predating E_close are allowed without all-pairs historical ordering gates, and optional plan/capital/Persona/saga/Registry/telemetry metadata is retained as diagnostics rather than mandatory gates. Original hosted.baseline_fleet remains immutable; proven pre-E external replacements are reported separately in phases.E_close.baseline_external_replacement alongside phases.E_close.nonchain_fleet_preservation. Original active_count restoration and zero active chain bindings remain mandatory."
    },
    "criterion_3_unknown_replacement_and_e_window_drift_honestly_paused": {
      "source_contract_verified": true,
      "hosted_runtime_acceptance_claimed": false,
      "summary": "Unknown replacement bindings, missing/unretired historical bindings, missing pre-E accepted-release or authoritative_loader_attestation evidence (showing correlation string difference alone is not accepted-release proof), missing Registry artifacts, exposed version mismatches, foreign-tenant or this-chain-tagged records, and any non-chain ID or comparable owner-state/version change during E_close remain paused with baseline_fleet_check='mismatch' (or 'chain_binding_still_active') and blocked_before='E_close:cleanup_incomplete'. Volatile diagnostic fields are excluded from pre/post E_close owner state comparison."
    },
